# Patched THIRD-PARTY pbos (APL-SA @LoBo mod content) must never enter this
# GPL repo. They are optional now (the config reader tolerates stock @LoBo's
# "0.0.1" tracer floats, and `PoseidonTools mod doctor <@LoBo> --fix` repairs
# @LoBo in place); gen-patched-pbos.ps1 regenerates them byte-identically
# from the local @LoBo install if wanted. The generator script and
# bin/config.cpp stay tracked, and bin/config.cpp is what the tests need.
*.pbo
